{
  "sourcePatchId": "979b006c-d2a5-47c1-836c-9f3f30453ddf",
  "name": "Analog Drumkit",
  "description": "Five velocity-sensitive analog synthesis voices selected by MIDI notnum through Switch. 35: Bass drum (pitch-swept sine + click); 36: Bass drum distorted (saturated sine + click); 46: Hi-hat open (700 ms); 42: Hi-hat closed (85 ms); 38: Snare (two sine resonances + filtered noise). Hats use six inharmonic square oscillators plus noise. One-shot decays survive short MIDI note-offs. Silent default; stereo output; no samples. GM bass-drum slot 36 is used for the distorted variation.",
